Z||000005||Mach10||11-06-2001||09:52 PM||||Bump steer should not be that pronounced... At least, it isn't on my end. Check out all your suspension, (tie-rods, Upper/lower balljoints, bearings, struts, shocks) for wear/movement. If so, fix the worn out part... I can guarantee you something's flocking with your suspension geometry (read: alignment)<P>Of course, it COULD be something as simple as low tire-pressure...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> <P>Good luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
